--- !u!114 &1289828498
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1289828496}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8b83d63ad662d944ba772861ccd31fa, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 887493811}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 827235926}
  dialogue:
  - Wow, look who I see!
  - The guard who stopped the great war but lost his family!
  - Now he's killed my soldiers.
  - It would have suited him.
  - I was waiting for you in the middle of the night.
  - I hear you steal things at night.
  - For example..
  - Poor people's taxes..
  - The revenues of your village..
  - Yeah, that stupid green midget told me everything.
  - It is obvious that that much liquor cannot be produced in your village.
  - Absolutely no coercion!
  - We found out when they bought goods from us.
  - If you don't want your village to know about this, you have to accept my offer.
  - At midnight tonight, you will go and steal the weapons from the lord's camp for
    me.
  - If you don't, I can have you killed right now.
  - Even if you don't die, my helpers know everything.
  - "Baz\u0131lar\u0131 da sizin k\xF6yde ajan."
  - Some of them are agents in your village.
  - ...
  - (move forward)
  wordSpeed: 0.02
  playerIsClose: 0
  interactIndicator: {fileID: 1381897331}
